WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.400
 Hi there, my name is Mostafa Anter and I am an experienced senior Android

00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:08.000
 developer with over 10 years of experience in the field.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.850
 I specialize in building scalable, high-performance mobile applications

00:00:12.850 --> 00:00:15.000
 using cutting-edge technologies.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.920
 Throughout my career, I've worked with Kotlin, Java, Jetpack Compose, and

00:00:20.920 --> 00:00:23.000
 multi-module architectures.

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:29.740
 I have a strong background in integrating third-party SDKs, implementing server-driven

00:00:29.740 --> 00:00:34.480
 UI and maintaining a high standard of code quality using test-driven

00:00:34.480 --> 00:00:36.000
